# Design lab account gate

Until the user explicitly cancels this order, **all design / visual / homepage UI experiments** must be gated so only the design-lab account sees them.

- Email: `cargo.shleg@gmail.com`
- Helper: `app.design_lab.is_design_lab_user`
- Template flag: `design_lab` (from `_template_context`)
- Body class when active: `design-lab`

## Rules

1. Do **not** change the default public design for anonymous users or other accounts.
2. Put new markup behind `{% if design_lab %}` (or equivalent), with the previous design in `{% else %}`.
3. Scope new CSS to `.design-lab` / `.home-hero--split` / other lab-only selectors — do not restyle shared components globally.
4. Keep adding emails only via `DESIGN_LAB_EMAILS` in `backend/app/design_lab.py`.
5. When the user says to cancel / roll out to everyone, remove the gate and ship the chosen design broadly.
